  "reasoning": "The defendant repeatedly stole copper cable from construction sites (盗窃) and then sold the stolen material to a scrap dealer, later receiving money for the stolen goods. This constitutes concealment of criminal proceeds (掩饰、隐瞒犯罪所得、犯罪所得收益). The other conduct (driving away a court‑seized car) is not covered by the provided charge list, so the applicable charges are theft and concealment of stolen property.",
  "final_answer": "盗窃;掩饰、隐瞒犯罪所得、犯罪所得收益"
